        "content": "Original Display Modes Transform Pocket&#x27;s display into the display on an original GB, GBC, or GBA. Quirks and all. Pocket&#x27;s 615ppi display allows astonishingly accurate recreation of original hardware display characteristics like backlight LCD effects, pixel grid patterns and LCD subpixel patterns.",
